docs {
Tolak kontribusi - comment (alasan) WAJIB. Entity jadi 'rejected'
(terminal; kontributor kirim ulang sebagai kontribusi baru), review row
status 'rejected' + comment, audit action "reject".

Request ini menolak kontribsi pelafalan dari Add Pronunciation.

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "contribution_id": "01JDContribution0000000001",
        "entity_type": "pronunciation",
        "entity_id": "01JDPronunciation0000000000",
        "status": "rejected"
      }
    }

400 tanpa comment:

    {
      "success": false,
      "error_code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
      "message": "Data yang dikirim tidak valid",
      "details": [ { "field": "comment", "message": "Alasan penolakan wajib diisi" } ]
    }
}

meta {
  name: Reject Contribution
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/contributions/{{pronunciation_contribution_id}}/reject
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "comment": "Pelafalan tidak sesuai penutur Sambas kota"
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + status rejected + entity_type pronunciation", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('rejected');
    expect(res.body.data.entity_type).to.equal('pronunciation');
  });
}
